00:21:17.640 --> 00:21:23.319
And I think what she sees with Ted is that, oh, this is the guy who says, who is who he says he is.
我认为她在泰德身上看到的是，哦，这就是那个言行一致的家伙。

00:21:23.319 --> 00:21:24.160
Yes.
是的。

00:21:24.160 --> 00:21:26.359
He is who his friends claim that he is.
