And so much of dating, like I remember when I would date in New York or LA, like a lot of times you know you meet people, you work with or you're set up.
在约会中，就像我记得我在纽约或洛杉矶约会时，很多时候你知道你会遇见一起工作的人，或者被介绍认识的人。

