还有寻找你的部落。

00:22:07.160 --> 00:22:24.500
And I think Ted is coming into focus for Robin in this episode as someone who is reliable and who can be depended upon and who in some ways you can roll your eyes and laugh at some of his quirks and ex-interesties, but it's ultimately like the best part about him.
我认为泰德在这一集中对罗宾来说变得清晰起来，他是一个可靠的、可以依赖的人，在某些方面你可以对他的怪癖和古怪翻白眼并嘲笑，但这最终是他身上最好的部分。

